#### **1. Meeting Cadence per Team**



* **Executive & Steering Committee (Monthly):** Strategic planning, budget authorization, major escalation decisions, and high-severity risk reviews.
* **Core Project / Lead Team (Bi-Weekly / Weekly):** Timeline reviews, cross-departmental dependency tracking, and key milestone sign-offs.
* **Engineering & Development Team (Weekly Sync / Daily Standups):** Sprint planning and load testing.
* **Field Operations & Logistics Team (Weekly Sync):** Site survey reviews, installer scheduling, weather/permit tracking, and physical hardware deployment progress.
* **Subcontractors & Vendor Partners (Bi-Weekly / Monthly Sync):** SLA compliance, quality spot-check findings, certification progress, and field delivery updates.


#### **2. Reporting Methods & Channels**



* **Real-Time Escalations (Microsoft Teams):** Immediate notification channels for critical system outages, or urgent field safety incidents.
* **Weekly Project Status Dashboard (Jira / Asana):** Operational tracking of active tasks, permit approvals, hardware supply lead times, and open risks.
* **Monthly Executive Report (PDF Briefing):** High-level summary detailing budget status, conversion metrics, milestone completion, and critical risk mitigations.
